--- a/Fuel-Calculator.md
+++ b/Fuel-Calculator.md
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ The two fuel figures sit in that row as **Gal/h** and **Taxi + T/O (gal)**:
 
 | Field | Meaning |
 | --- | --- |
-| **Gallons per hour** | Cruise burn. From the aircraft type (C172: 8.5). |
